Alpha adaptation by DSH Themes contributors.

Default memory storage now resolves through the official dshHomePath helper under the active DSH_HOME; an explicitly configured dataDir remains unchanged. Existing global TDAI data is not automatically copied or deleted.
Debug diagnostics report whether a key is configured without disclosing any key characters.
Alpha peer coordinates replace old release candidates. All extraction, recall, conversation capture, embedding backends, tools, UI, and production dependencies are retained.

Upstream MIT license retained. Installation/lifecycle verification is separate from configured model and embedding functionality.
